gdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16iam.jpg"}, {"id": 1983256, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16iag.jpg"}, {"id": 1983258, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16iai.jpg"}], "slug": "hell-n-slash", "storyline": "The Hunter, a lone warrior in black armor and a tattered cloak, carrying a sword too big for any man and a crossbow strapped to his arm, is thrown into the Abyss by the Maker, a bored god who built this place for his own amusement. Beyond the portal wait 100 chambers of stone, bone and embers across four regions: the Ash Crypts, the Forges of Exile, the Halls of Oaths and, at last, the Threshold. Every death sends the Hunter back to the Hall of Ashes, a ruined cathedral where five residents keep their own stories and favors, while the Maker watches from his throne, narrates each failure with sarcasm and talks straight to the player. To break free, the Hunter must descend again and again, seal pacts with ancient powers and defeat the guardians of each region.", "summary": "A brutal dark fantasy hack'n'slash roguelike. Carve through 100 cursed chambers with a colossal sword, an arm-mounted crossbow and an iron grappling hook. Seal pacts in wax and blood, and outlast the bored god who narrates every single one of your deaths.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/hell-n-slash", "videos": [{"id": 201639, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "CTyzfbotW4g", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CTyzfbotW4g", "title": "Hell n' Slash | Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/CTyzfbotW4g/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}